                                                "sense_id": "2a42969f-2ce8-3d48-8008-c44bdf2a55f6",
                                                "text": "The whole thing has rotted into a festival of bad faith and victimology, those twin markers of the Trump-Twitter Decade: rather an irony for a show organized under the sign of friendship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
